# Cross-project priority view

Curated by the agent — highest priority first, across all registered projects.
Each entry links to the detail item in that project's own TODO file. Keep this
list short; detail belongs in `todos/<project>/TODO.md`.

Format: `- [ ] [project] one-line summary — see todos/<project>/TODO.md#anchor`

Copy this to `SQUEEZER_HOME/todos/TODO.md` once you've registered real
projects in `SQUEEZER_HOME/config.json` — that file will contain real project
names and details, so it stays local to your own install.

- [ ] [example-project] one-line summary of the top-priority item — see
      todos/example-project/TODO.md
